          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=2&verse=12"
          ],
          "text": "ዳእሙ፡ በጽምው፡ ተሀሉ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 15,
          "unit_order": 15,
          "source_marker": "13",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=2&verse=13"
          ],
          "text": "እስመ፡ አዳም፡ ቀደመ፡ ተፈጥሮ፡ ወእምድኅሬሁ፡ ሔዋን።"
        },
        {
          "number": 16,
          "unit_order": 16,
          "source_marker": "14",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=2&verse=14"
          ],
          "text": "ወአዳምሰ፡ ኢስሕተ፡ አላ፡ ብእሲት፡ ስሕተት፡ ወዐለወት።"
        },
        {
          "number": 17,
          "unit_order": 17,
          "source_marker": "15",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=2&verse=15"
          ],
          "text": "ወባሕቱ፡ ተሐዩ፡ በእንተ፡ ውሉዳ። ለእመ፡ ነበሩ፡ በሃይማኖት፡ ወበተፋቅሮ፡ ወበቅድሳት፡ ወበአንጽሖ፡ ርእሶሙ፡ በአእምሮ።"
        }
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
