          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=3&verse=4"
          ],
          "text": "ዘሠናይ፡ ሥርዐተ፡ ቤቱ። ዘቦ፡ ውሉድ፡ ዘይትኤዘዙ፡ በኵሉ፡ ንጽሕ።"
