            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=3&verse=15"
          ],
          "text": "ወእመሰ፡ ጐንደይኩ፡ ከመ፡ ታእምር፡ ዘከመ፡ ትሠርዕ፡ ቤተ፡ ክርስቲያኑ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር። ሕያው፡ ዐምዳ፡ ወድዳ፡ ለጽድቅ፡ አማን፡ ዐቢይ። እስመ፡ ምክሩ፡ ለዝንቱ፡ ጽድቅ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 19,
          "unit_order": 19,
          "source_marker": "16",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=3&verse=16"
          ],
          "text": "ዝኬ፡ ዘአስተርአየ፡ በሥጋ፡ ሰብእ፡ ወጸድቀ፡ በመንፈስ። ወአስተርአዮሙ፡ ለመላእክት፡ ወሰበክዎ፡ ውስተ፡ አሕዛብ። ወተአመነ፡ ውስተ፡ ዓለም፡ ወዐርገ፡ በስብሐት።"
        }
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "chapter": 4,
      "source_chapter_label": "4",
      "heading": [
        "ምዕራፍ 4"
      ],
      "units": [
        {
          "number": 1,
          "unit_order": 1,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "ትንቢት፡ በእንተ፡ ዐላውያን"
        },
        {
          "number": 2,
          "unit_order": 2,
          "source_marker": "1",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=1"
          ],
          "text": "ወመንፈስ፡ ገሃደ፡ ይነግር፡ ከመ፡ በደኃሪ፡ መዋዕል፡ የዐልዉ፡ ሃይማኖቶሙ፡ ብዙኃን። ወይተልውዎሙ፡ ለአጋንንት፡ እኩያን፡ ወመስሕታን፡ ወትምህርተ፡ ሰይጣን፡ ዘያናፍቅ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 3,
          "unit_order": 3,
          "source_marker": "2",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=2"
          ],
          "text": "ነባብያነ፡ ሐሰት፡ እለ፡ ንዱዳን፡ በኅሊናሆሙ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 4,
          "unit_order": 4,
          "source_marker": "3",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=3"
          ],
          "text": "እለ፡ የሐርሙ፡ አውስቦ፡ ወይከልኡ፡ መባልዕተ፡ ዘእግዚአብሔር፡ ፈጠረ፡ ለምእመናን። ከመ፡ ይሴሰዩ፡ ወያእኵቱ፡ እለ፡ የአምርዋ፡ ለጽድቅ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 5,
          "unit_order": 5,
          "source_marker": "4",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=4"
          ],
          "text": "እስመ፡ ኵሉ፡ ተግባረ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ሠናይ። ወአልቦ፡ ግዱፍ፡ ወኢ፡ ምንትኒ፡ ለእመ፡ ተወክፍዎ፡ እንዘ፡ የአኵቱ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 6,
          "unit_order": 6,
          "source_marker": "5",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=5"
          ],
          "text": "እስመ፡ ይትቄደስ፡ በቃለ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ወበጸሎት።"
        },
        {
          "number": 7,
          "unit_order": 7,
          "source_marker": "6",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=6"
          ],
          "text": "ወዘንተ፡ መሀሮሙ፡ ለአኀዊከ፡ ወትከውን፡ ኅሩየ፡ ላእከ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ። እንዘ፡ ትሴስዮሙ፡ ቃለ፡ ሃይማኖት፡ ወሠናየ፡ ትምህርተ፡ ዘተምህርከ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 8,
          "unit_order": 8,
          "source_marker": "7",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=7"
          ],
          "text": "ወለመሐድምተ፡ ዕቤራትሰ፡ ርኩስ፡ እበዮ፡ ወአግርር፡ ርእሰከ፡ ለጽድቅ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 9,
          "unit_order": 9,
          "source_marker": "8",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=8"
          ],
          "text": "እስመ፡ ግዝረትሰ፡ በሥጋ፡ ለኅዳጥ፡ ዘመን፡ ትበቊዕ። ወጽድቅሰ፡ ታሠልጥ፡ በኵሉ፡ ወባቲ፡ ተስፋ፡ ሕይወት፡ በዝ፡ ዓለም፡ ወበዘይመጽእ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 10,
          "unit_order": 10,
          "source_marker": "9",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=9"
          ],
          "text": "እሙን፡ ነገሩ፡ ወርቱዕ፡ ይትወከፍዎ፡ በኵሉ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 11,
          "unit_order": 11,
          "source_marker": "10",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=10"
          ],
          "text": "እስመ፡ በእንተ፡ ዝ፡ ንሠርሕ፡ ወንጼአል። እስመ፡ ተወከልነ፡ በእግዚአብሔር፡ ሕያው፡ ወማሕየዊ፡ ለኵሉ፡ ሰብእ፡ ወፈድፋደሰ፡ ለመሃይምናን።"
        },
        {
          "number": 12,
          "unit_order": 12,
          "source_marker": "11",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=11"
          ],
          "text": "ከመ፡ ዝ፡ መሀር፡ ወገሥጽ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 13,
          "unit_order": 13,
          "source_marker": "12",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=12"
          ],
          "text": "ወአልቦ፡ ዘያስተአብዳ፡ ለውርዝትከ። ወኩኖሙ፡ አርአያ፡ ወአምሳለ፡ ለመሃይምናን፡ በቃልከ፡ ወበምግባሪከ፡ በፍቅር፡ ወበሃይማኖት፡ ወበንጽሕ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 14,
          "unit_order": 14,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "በእንተ፡ ኢያስትቶ፡ ጸጋ፡ ምሂር"
        },
        {
          "number": 15,
          "unit_order": 15,
          "source_marker": "13",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=13"
          ],
          "text": "ወተዐቀብ፡ እስከ፡ እመጽእ፡ በአንብቦ፡ ወበምሂር፡ ወበገሥጾ፡ ወበጸልዮ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 16,
          "unit_order": 16,
          "source_marker": "14",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=14"
          ],
          "text": "ወኢታስትት፡ ጸጋሁ፡ ዘላዕሌከ፡ ዘተውህበከ፡ ምስለ፡ ተነብዮ፡ ወምስለ፡ ሢመተ፡ እዴሆሙ፡ ለጳጳሳት።"
        },
        {
          "number": 17,
          "unit_order": 17,
          "source_marker": "15",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=15"
          ],
          "text": "ዘንተ፡ አንብብ፡ ወበዝ፡ ሀሉ፡ ከመ፡ ይትዐወቅ፡ ሥላጤከ፡ በኵለሄ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 18,
          "unit_order": 18,
          "source_marker": "16",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=4&verse=16"
          ],
          "text": "ዑቅ፡ እንከ፡ ርእሰከ፡ በእንተ፡ አንብቦ፡ ወዘልፈ፡ ሀሉ፡ ባቲ። ወእመሰ፡ ዘንተ፡ ገበርከ፡ ርእሰከሂ፡ ታድኅን፡ ወዘሂ፡ ይሰምዐከ።"
        }
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "chapter": 5,
      "source_chapter_label": "5",
      "heading": [
        "ምዕራፍ 5"
      ],
      "units": [
        {
          "number": 1,
          "unit_order": 1,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "በእንተ፡ ክብረ፡ ልሂቃን፡ ወተአዝዞቶሙ"
        },
        {
          "number": 2,
          "unit_order": 2,
          "source_marker": "1",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=5&verse=1"
          ],
          "text": "ሊቃናተ፡ ኢታመጕጽ፡ ተአዘዝ፡ ከመ፡ ዘለአቡከ፡ ወለንኡሳን፡ ከመ፡ ዘለአኀዊከ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 3,
          "unit_order": 3,
          "source_marker": "2",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=5&verse=2"
          ],
          "text": "ወለልሂቃትሂ፡ ከመ፡ ዘለእምከ፡ ወለንኡሳትሂ፡ ከመ፡ ዘለአኀዊከ፡ በኵሉ፡ ንጽሕ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 4,
          "unit_order": 4,
          "source_marker": "3",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=5&verse=3"
          ],
          "text": "ወአክብር፡ ዕቤራተ፡ በጽድቅ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 5,
          "unit_order": 5,
          "source_marker": "4",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=5&verse=4"
          ],
          "text": "ወእመ፡ ቦ፡ እምኔሆሙ፡ ዕቤር፡ እንተ፡ ባቲ፡ ውሉድ፡ አው፡ ደቂቀ፡ ውሉድ። ይትመሀሩ፡ ቅድመ፡ አሠንዮ፡ ለቤቶሙ፡ ወይሴሰዩ፡ አዝማዲሆሙ። እስመ፡ ከማሁ፡ ሠናይ፡ ወሥሙር፡ በቅድመ፡ እግዚአብሔር።"
        },
        {
          "number": 6,
          "unit_order": 6,
          "source_marker": "5",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=5&verse=5"
          ],
          "text": "ወእንተሰ፡ ዕቤር፡ በአማን፡ ንጽሕት። እንተ፡ ባሕቲታ፡ ትነብር፡ እስመ፡ ትውክልታ፡ እግዚአብሔር። ወትፀመድ፡ ጸሎተ፡ ወትስእል፡ መዓልተ፡ ወሌሊተ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 7,
          "unit_order": 7,
          "source_marker": "6",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=5&verse=6"
          ],
          "text": "ወእንተሰ፡ ትፌግዕ፡ ምስለ፡ ተውኔት፡ ምዉት፡ ይእቲ፡ እንዘ፡ ሕያዋ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 8,
          "unit_order": 8,
          "source_marker": "7",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=5&verse=7"
          ],
          "text": "ወከመ፡ ዝ፡ ገሥጽ፡ ከመ፡ ኢያድልዉ፡ ወኢያመክንዩ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 9,
          "unit_order": 9,
          "source_marker": "8",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=5&verse=8"
          ],
          "text": "ወዘሰ፡ ኢይኄሊ፡ ለቤቱ፡ ወይገድፍ፡ አዝማዲሁ። ውእቱ፡ ክሕደ፡ ሃይማኖቶ፡ ወየአኪ፡ እምዘኢየአምን።"
        },
        {
          "number": 10,
          "unit_order": 10,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "በእንተ፡ ኅርየተ፡ ዲያቆናት"
        },
        {
          "number": 11,
          "unit_order": 11,
          "source_marker": "9",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=5&verse=9"
          ],
          "text": "ወለእመ፡ ኀረይከ፡ ዕቤረ፡ ኅረይ፡ እንተ፡ ስሳ፡ ክረምታ። እንተ፡ አሐደ፡ ብእሴ፡ አውሰበት።"
        },
        {
          "number": 12,
          "unit_order": 12,
          "source_marker": "10",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Ti&chapter=5&verse=10"
          ],
          "text": "እንተ፡ ይንእድዋ፡ በኵሉ፡ ምግባረ፡ ሠናይ፡ ለእመ፡ አልሀቀት፡ ውሉዳ። ወለእመ፡ ነግደ፡ ተወክፈት፡ ወለእመ፡ እግረ፡ ጻድቃን፡ ኀፀበት። ወእመ፡ ርኁበ፡ አጽገበት፡ ወኵሎ፡ ምግባረ፡ ሠናይ፡ ለእመ፡ ተለወት።"
        },
        {
